    "body": "```\n Call to a member function getType() on boolean in /mysite/mod/search/views/default/search/object/comment/entity.php:15\n```\n\ni have seen these errors in my logs for over a year. having explored the cause, i found that this line does not find a container when i am logged out and the search results point to a specific comment (which apparently has been orphaned somehow):\n\n```\n$container = $entity->getContainerEntity()\n```\n",
